> The <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`isReadOnly`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`IsReadOnly`" pulumi-lang-go="`isReadOnly`" pulumi-lang-python="`is_read_only`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`isReadOnly`" pulumi-lang-java="`isReadOnly`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`is_read_only`">`isReadOnly`</span> field is deprecated and non-functional. Use <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`restrictedRoles`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`RestrictedRoles`" pulumi-lang-go="`restrictedRoles`" pulumi-lang-python="`restricted_roles`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`restrictedRoles`" pulumi-lang-java="`restrictedRoles`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`restricted_roles`">`restrictedRoles`</span> instead to define which roles are required to edit the dashboard.

## Example Usage

