Provides a Datadog Tag Indexing Rule Order resource. Manages the evaluation order of tag indexing rules for an org. Only one instance of this resource should exist per org; the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`name`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Name`" pulumi-lang-go="`name`" pulumi-lang-python="`name`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`name`" pulumi-lang-java="`name`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`name`">`name`</span> field is a user-chosen identifier with no server-side equivalent.

